# Frontend Structure

- Keep frontend pages in clear `HTML`, `CSS`, and `JSON` files.
- Put each screen in its own folder under `frontend/screens/<screen-name>/`.
- For shared/repeated UI elements, create reusable files under `frontend/components/`.
- Prefer simple, readable structure over framework-specific complexity.
